    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Mbashe Estuary, aerial photograph. This estuary drains a catchment area of over 6000 square kilometres. Photographed in Dwesa Nature Reserve, Eastern Cape, South Africa.</rdf:li>
